    "title": "Handoff Owner Ambiguity Across Outsourced Company Functions",
    "excerpt": "A source-led field protocol for cross-functional queue fragmentation, with a declared population, denominator discipline, adverse cases, independent replay, privacy controls, and explicit limits.",
